        "llc_mpki": 17.9167,
        "llc_miss_ratio": 0.4778
      },
      "recommendation": "Improve locality: tile or block loops to fit the LLC, use struct-of-arrays for scanned fields, prefer contiguous containers over pointer-chasing, and prefetch for irregular access.",
      "why": "Low IPC together with many LLC misses means the core is waiting on DRAM. Top-down analysis (perf stat --topdown) can confirm it on supported CPUs."
    },
