      "recommendation": "Back the hot heap with huge pages (madvise(MADV_HUGEPAGE), THP, or hugetlbfs). A 2 MiB page covers 512x the reach of a 4 KiB TLB entry. See the hugepages findings.",
      "why": "With a few thousand TLB entries x 4 KiB, reach is only a few MiB; larger random-access working sets miss constantly."
    },
